<th id="S4.T4.2.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt"><span id="S4.T4.2.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Accuracy</span> (%)</th></tr>
